    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels so hollow. like, even if i talked to someone, it wouldn't matter. it's all just noise. like we're all just performing these roles in a simulation that has no actual meaning or soul behind it. it's not even that i'm \"sad\" in the traditional way, it's just that there's no point to the loop. why keep the program running if the output is always just more emptiness?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
